---
description: Use Card as="li" for cards inside lists; never wrap Card in a separate li
alwaysApply: true
---

# Card in lists

When cards are items of a list, render the list as `ul` (or `Flex as="ul"`) and pass `as="li"` to `Card`. Do not wrap `Card` in a separate `<li>`.

```tsx
// BAD
<ul>
  <li>
    <Card>...</Card>
  </li>
</ul>

// GOOD
<Flex as="ul" direction="column" rowGap={20}>
  <Card as="li">...</Card>
</Flex>
```

Standalone cards outside lists stay as the default (`div`).
